      "en": "The people came to Bethel and sat there until evening before God, and lifted up their voices, and wept severely.",
      "ko": "백성이 벧엘에 이르러 거기서 저녁까지 하나님 앞에 앉아서 대성통곡하여",
      "source_text_hash": "748cce10bd7fe1f41f95251065793e6858bbe075e269bcf71544fd8579f26da0",
      "translation_text_hash": "698a446058121381ed0321b374d1c6cdf16dd7af5f724c1c8ab0fef671e9f62b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
