      "en": "For when the people were counted, behold, there were none of the inhabitants of Jabesh Gilead there.",
      "ko": "백성을 계수할 때에 야베스 길르앗 거민이 하나도 거기 없음을 보았음이라",
      "source_text_hash": "3de117b9904ba0c1b5dbe0786ddc8e1f3162e2cc0cdce9d7016f682020671321",
      "translation_text_hash": "70948c9911a3f5a4ae0131d51adbc21205396c1745aeb5439dbc0c3659a24523",
