        "verse": 11
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 21,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "This is the thing that you shall do: you shall utterly destroy every male, and every woman who has lain with a man.”",
      "ko": "너희의 행할 일은 모든 남자와 남자와 잔 여자를 진멸할 것이니라 하였더니",
      "source_text_hash": "67b46bafacfb3c15794bcf549bafc81fa334f9c037f6cc911995fde5bb7f0a54",
      "translation_text_hash": "bf7e596a1a9a74b8feac5acded1bc2c2cdbd1b4b2c378d002858901e5a36500b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "너희의 행할 일은 모든 남자와 남자와 잔 여자를 진멸할 것이니라 하였더니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "bf7e596a1a9a74b8feac5acded1bc2c2cdbd1b4b2c378d002858901e5a36500b"
