      ],
      "en": "In those days there was no king in Israel. Everyone did that which was right in his own eyes.",
      "ko": "그 때에 이스라엘에 왕이 없으므로 사람이 각각 그 소견에 옳은대로 행하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "8b8cf3679f78bc6ba2461ab0a4d43eacd54ee3be9a8f295d4ff6a7b3fff41c2f",
      "translation_text_hash": "8433ca5413dcd5b04aa73a9c3264a10300c6a5bc72f4fbdebf6c30c9f3c9906c",
